                    {
                      "id": "skill-deployment",
                      "type": "skill-topic",
                      "schemaVersion": 1,
                      "props": {
                        "label": "Deployment",
                        "animation": "deployment",
                        "body": {
                          "type": "doc",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "One thing that my younger self asked himself was: "
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Working and developing on projects is fine but how can I make the finished result accessible to others?",
                                  "marks": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "italic"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "After some time I started looking into servers and hosting, proper Git and Version Controlling and what tools are available for making websites available to others. Learning tools like Jenkins and how to deploy projects was one part, the other one was learning how to set up a linux server and installing the necessary software."
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Nowadays I also look into distribution platforms like Vercel, Netlify or Coolify, as they make publishing projects on a smaller scale very easy and more manageable for a single person."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
